  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">School as Community Center: A national multi stakeholder approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed action aims to transform the model into a national mainstream approach for educational and PCVE stakeholders and to deepen the community implementation of the model with current and also new stakeholders (e.g. youth councils at the municipal level).</narrative>
